<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>AI Financial Insight Report</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Helvetica', 'Arial', sans-serif; color: #334155; margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.5; }
        .header { background-color: {{brandPrimaryColorHex}}; color: white; padding: 40px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
        .header-content h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 28px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; }
        .header-content p { margin: 5px 0 0; opacity: 0.8; font-size: 14px; }
        .logo { max-height: 60px; max-width: 200px; }
        
        .content { padding: 40px; }
        .section { margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .section-title { font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: {{brandPrimaryColorHex}}; border-bottom: 2px solid {{brandPrimaryColorHex}}; padding-bottom: 5px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        
        .insight-card { background-color: #f8fafc; border-left: 5px solid {{brandPrimaryColorHex}}; padding: 20px; border-radius: 4px; font-style: italic; color: #1e293b; }
        
        .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin-top: 20px; }
        .stat-card { background-color: white; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; }
        .stat-label { font-size: 10px; color: #64748b; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: bold; }
        .stat-value { font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #0f172a; margin-top: 5px; }
        
        .narrative-content { white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 13px; color: #334155; }
        .narrative-content h2, .narrative-content h3 { color: {{brandPrimaryColorHex}}; margin-top: 20px; }
        
        .footer { padding: 20px 40px; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-size: 10px; color: #94a3b8; text-align: center; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <div class="header-content">
            <h1>Financial Intelligence Report</h1>
            <p>{{projectName}} • Generated by SentinelFi AI</p>
        </div>
        {{#if brandLogoBase64}}
        <img class="logo" src="{{brandLogoBase64}}" alt="Logo">
        {{/if}}
    </div>

    <div class="content">
        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-title">Project Overview</div>
            <div class="grid">
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="stat-label">Total Budgeted</div>
                    <div class="stat-value">{{formattedTotalBudget}}</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="stat-label">Actual Expenditure</div>
                    <div class="stat-value">{{formattedTotalActual}}</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="stat-label">Remaining Buffer</div>
                    <div class="stat-value">{{formattedRemaining}}</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-title">AI Executive Summary</div>
            <div class="insight-card">
                "Our analysis indicates that based on current burn rates and variance profiles, the project is 
                positioning for {{riskLevel}} performance. Below is a detailed breakdown of findings."
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-title">Detailed Financial Narrative</div>
            <div class="narrative-content">
                {{{aiNarrative}}}
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-title">AI Recommendations</div>
            <ul style="font-size: 13px;">
                {{#each recommendations}}
                <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">{{this}}</li>
                {{/each}}
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        Confidential Financial Intelligence • {{tenantName}} • {{companyAddress}} • Generated on {{generationDate}}
    </div>
</body>
</html>
